{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THIS IS A DEMO WITH LESS FEATURES, WISHLIST FOR MORE<br>(full version includes tons more abilities, enemies, music, etc)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">type your fingers off, trying to defend yourself and feel like a wannabe hacker in this fast paced TYPING game. type the name of the enemy to defeat it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">hold your ground against ever growing waves of new and different enemies, with unique mechanics, varying in the movement, the way you have to spell them, or... well you will see\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">unlock new commands to type in, to use against the enemies in strategic ways</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the roguelike system allows you to start over, still with all your unlocked commands, and jokers to skip waves you previously passed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">this game is not for everyone, so be warned, true skill comes from practice</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893260?t=1754344658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893260?t=1754344658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893260/7d9b820cae8cfbb2a05013d9132b00b694daca38/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754344658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893260/7d9b820cae8cfbb2a05013d9132b00b694daca38/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754344658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Leaderbo